DALALIMSOMI API DOCUMENCTATION

================ IDENTIFIER CONVENTION ================

- User IDs are UUIDs. This includes `users.id`, JWT `id`, `hostId`, `agentId`,
    `clientId`, and `houseOwnerId` when they refer to a user.
- All non-user entity IDs are UUID strings:
    - `houseId`
    - `roomId`
    - house-image IDs
    - room-image IDs
    - rent-request `id` and `rentRequestId`
    - password-reset-token IDs
- UUID path parameters must use the canonical form, for example:
    `7809f718-8b2b-4369-9eb0-e00c7c37815e`.
- Existing databases are converted by Liquibase changesets
    `22-non-user-ids-uuid`, `23-collection-join-ids-uuid`, and
    `25-user-ids-uuid-preserve-existing-data`. Do not edit already
    applied changesets because that changes their checksums.

