====> Add a room to a house by role HOST, AGENT or ADMIN
Method: POST
URL : http://localhost:8080/house/rooms/:houseId
Headers : {
    "Authorization": "Bearer <token>"
}
JSON : {
  "price": 15000,
  "houseType": "SINGLE_ROOM",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "images": [
    {
      "base64Data": "data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAA",
      "category": "bedroom"
    }
  ]
}

NOTES:
- images and clientId are optional.
- paymentDuration is filled automatically from the house and is not accepted as
  a create-room input.
- houseType values: SINGLE_ROOM, SELF_CONTAINED, HOUSE, APARTMENT, FRAME, GUEST_HOUSE.
- status values: AVAILABLE, PENDING, APPROVED, DECLINED.
- If clientId is provided when creating a room, its status cannot be AVAILABLE.

