====> Update room by id by role HOST, AGENT or ADMIN
Method: PATCH
URL : http://localhost:8080/house/rooms/:roomId
Headers : {
    "Authorization": "Bearer <token>"
}
JSON : {
  "price": 17000,
  "houseType": "SELF_CONTAINED",
  "clientId": "25252525-2525-4252-8252-252525252525",
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "images": [
    {
      "base64Data": "data:image/jpeg;base64,<encoded-image-data>",
      "category": "bedroom"
    }
  ]
}

Room images are optional. Omit `images` to keep the current images; provide an
array to add images to the existing collection. Each image uses the same
`base64Data` and optional `category` fields as room creation.

To make a room vacant, send:
JSON : {
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}
This clears the room clientId.

Room paymentDuration is managed from the house and cannot be changed in this
room update request. Updating the house paymentDuration updates all its rooms.


